minimal disarray of clothing, their connection is mechanical—devoid of kisses or conversation. This act is Kotori's self-invented \"routine,\" a means to transform herself from the introverted girl she once was.\n\nOne day, Kotori finds herself saved from a predicament by Eiji, a second-year senior. Charming, cheerful, and kind to everyone, Eiji embodies the ideal Kotori aspires to become. Determined to reinvent herself and emulate Eiji, Kotori doubles down on her routine with Takumi, taking bold steps toward a new version of herself—\n\nA story of two awkward souls fumbling their way toward youth, bound by a secret connection.","year":2026,"status":"ongoing","lastChapter":null,"contentRating":"suggestive","tags":["Romance","Drama"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/32db4174-7944-40c4-9f76-4c322177bc04/f3a1077a-6b65-4748-8930-cfb058e63714.jpg.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ja","availableLanguages":["vi","pt-br","es-la","id","en"],"lane":"manga","rating":5.35,"follows":17985,"listAt":"2026-10-23T05:00:53.021Z","chapters":[{"id":"e40b1548-dd3a-4a48-b5e9-243b2c870181","number":"4","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"id","pages":36,"createdAt":"2026-10-08T14:00:43+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"72a9c744-bfbf-4a5e-8620-a2cd168aac53","number":"3","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"id","pages":40,"createdAt":"2026-09-28T14:07:59+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"72600256-517c-4380-a8f7-c5ac272dfb4a","number":"2","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"id","pages":31,"createdAt":"2026-09-29T02:40:48+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"d03ad06f-3486-4cd4-9c50-c2f276d69cf3","number":"1","volume":null,"title":"The Secret Routine of the Solitary Ice Princess","lang":"en","pages":35,"createdAt":"2026-07-02T14:05:23+00:00","baked":false}],"chapterCount":4,"chaptersAt":"2026-10-19T10:28:33.415Z"},"1418c8ba-6b5f-4a9a-8546-cea35cc69d27":{"id":"1418c8ba-6b5f-4a9a-8546-cea35cc69d27","title":"Mahouka Koukou no Rettousei - Escape-hen","altTitle":"The Irregular at Magic High School - Escape Arc","